  "description": "Ji Hyeonseok and Kim Beomwoo have been friends for seven years. It’s obvious from a mile away that they’re mutually pining for each other, but Hyeonseok, oblivious to his own feelings, treats Beomwoo like a convenient pushover.\n\nIt gets to the point where a nasty rumor spreads through their department that _“Kim Beomwoo from Mechanical Design is Ji Hyeonseok’s doormat.”_ Even then, Hyeonseok thinks it’s all _“Kim Beomwoo’s fault”_ for always indulging his unreasonable demands.\n\nThen one day, Hyeonseok finds a mysterious package at Beomwoo’s apartment and learns that Beomwoo has a crush on someone...\n\n_Source: Lezhin, translated_",
